{"name":"Artiste","hex":"#987387","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"artiste","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A public performer, especially of song or dance.","Any person with artistic skill, such as a hairdresser or a cook."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/artiste"}],"entries":[{"title":"Artiste (manga)","blocks":[{"text":"Artiste  is a Japanese manga series written and illustrated by Tarō Samoedo. It began serialization in Shinchosha's seinen manga magazine Monthly Comic Bunch in September 2016."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/48/Artiste_manga_volume_1_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artiste_(manga)","wikidata":"Q124661464"},{"title":"Artiste (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Artiste is a 2025 Indian Telugu-language thriller film directed by Ratan Rishi. The film was produced by James Watt Kommu. The film stars Sonia Akula, Santosh Kalwacherla, Vinay Varma, Prabhakar, Satyam Rajesh, Tanikella Bharani, Thagubothu Ramesh, Sudharshan. The film was theatrically released on 21 March 2025."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/db/Artiste_Telugu_Movie_Poster.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artiste_(film)","wikidata":"Q136368469"},{"title":"Artist","blocks":[{"text":"An artist is a person who creates art or practices the arts. The most common usage in everyday speech and academic discourse refers to a practitioner of the visual arts, such as painting or drawing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Artists_Collage.png/330px-Artists_Collage.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artist","wikidata":"Q483501"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Johann_Heinrich_Wilhe